      "content": "hey, ive been feeling really weird lately. i had the flu a few weeks ago and i thought i was over it, but i still feel super wiped out. like, even just walking up a flight of stairs makes me super out of breath and my heart feels like it's fluttering or thumping in my chest. it also feels kinda heavy in my chest sometimes too. is this just like normal post-flu fatigue or something? i'm kinda worried but i don't want to go to the doctor if it's nothing.",
